WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.325
The game is four building blocks working together.

2
00:00:03.577 --> 00:00:07.402
A timer makes a rock every second, at a random height.

3
00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:12.903
Velocity carries each rock left, and auto destroy removes it off screen.

4
00:00:13.156 --> 00:00:17.381
An overlap takes a life, and a second timer adds to the score.
